/P 278 0 R
/E (The Alice & Charles Taylor Scholar-Athlete LEAD Scholarship was created to honor the legacy of Charles and Alice Taylor and the profound influence they had on their family. Their example of hard work, integrity, service, encouragement, and belief in education and athletics helped shape the paths of their children and continues to inspire this scholarship today.)
